apanese style bow) to shoot through targets and enemies with maximum speed and precision! \n\nYour aiming prowess is only part of the equation though, as you\u2019ll also need to dodge and block enemy arrows!\n\nHone your archery skills by completing 80 levels of various challenges in Solo Mode, or Duel against an AI opponent in Versus Mode!\n\nMaster the way of the bow with BOW MAN! ", "short_description": "BOW MAN is a Japanese style classic VR bow game! Your mission is to shoot enemies and targets as accurate and quickly as possible."}]}, "developer_name": "DMM.com LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://terms.dmm.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DMM.com LLC", "support_website_url": "https://forms.gle/SASdkLWkUVDpxpW9A", "website_url": "https://bowman.vrlab.dmm.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["SHOOTER", "FIGHTING", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1243239779498379"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_201966598319066_1067758507260126086_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=noBoL4oZPMcQ7kNvwH9Uwi0&_nc_oc=AdrQ8adTyjEKb5a7DmP12sRITOkhZP3QZbLqwh4PlXdSFFef38yl7-LqNkeLudwz4F4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJgtu2tqlZ7E1Nd-z_XbRVWC8wPjeraeZMezdOCLEkBKw&oe=6AA2BBF9"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": fa